        {
            "timestamp": 1775232433,
            "reviewer": {
                "name": "Prabha Veerubhotla",
                "email": "vvlprabha@gmail.com",
                "username": "Prabha-Veerubhotla"
            },
            "message": "Abandoned\n\nIn the D-Bus object path:\n/xyz/openbmc_project/software/<swId>\nthe Yosemite4 platform is currently exposing incorrect / non-canonical software IDs in <swId>. For example, it reports something like:\nSentinel_Dome_Bic\nwhen it should use the full, uniquely identifying software ID, e.g.:\nYosemite_4_Sentinel_Dome_Slot_1_BIC_d04d3805\nThis mismatch leads to duplicate D-Bus paths for software objects on Yosemite4."
        }
    ],
